==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} A [[chronic]] [[disease]] caused by [[compulsive]] and uncontrollable consumption of [[alcohol]]ic [[beverage]]s, leading to [[addiction]] and deterioration in health and social functioning.
# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} Acute alcohol poisoning.

